# Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43 vendor demo bundle — local-only
# reference (346 MB, ~3 800 files: LVGL source, Waveshare demos, Espressif
# components). The bits we actually ship are trimmed-down ports under
# firmware/main/displays/amoled_sh8601/ with attribution preserved.
# Download:
#   https://files.waveshare.com/wiki/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.43/ESP32-S3-AMOLED-1.43-Demo-V3.zip
docs/ESP32-S3-AMOLED-1.43-Demo/

# Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.75 vendor demo bundle — local-only
# reference (344 MB: ESP-IDF/Arduino examples, the CO5300 BSP, schematic).
# The bits we actually ship are trimmed-down ports under
# firmware/main/displays/amoled_co5300_175/ with attribution preserved.
# Download from the board's Waveshare product page.
docs/ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.75/